WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.961 --> 00:00:04.004
My whole life

00:00:04.295 --> 00:00:05.463
was based on a lie.

00:00:06.297 --> 00:00:07.507
Can't go back to the way things were.

00:00:08.216 --> 00:00:10.593
A real man doesn't avoid hard things.

00:00:11.553 --> 00:00:12.929
He faces what scares him.

00:00:13.388 --> 00:00:13.888
Will!

00:00:13.888 --> 00:00:14.222
Will.

00:00:14.222 --> 00:00:14.556
Will.

00:00:14.556 --> 00:00:14.931
-Will.
-Will!

00:00:14.931 --> 00:00:15.306
Will!

00:00:15.306 --> 00:00:15.765
Will!

00:00:16.725 --> 00:00:18.351
Get dressed and buckle up, fool!

00:00:22.313 --> 00:00:23.106
We need to talk.

00:00:23.106 --> 00:00:24.858
The house just isn't the same when...

00:00:24.858 --> 00:00:25.567
...Will's not home.

00:00:27.277 --> 00:00:28.278
What's going on, Will?

00:00:28.278 --> 00:00:29.446
I just want to take care of myself.

00:00:30.071 --> 00:00:30.905
I've been staying in South LA.

00:00:31.948 --> 00:00:33.158
Where'd this money come from?

00:00:33.575 --> 00:00:35.076
Just a couple streetball games, no big deal.

00:00:37.245 --> 00:00:38.913
Okay, now I'm worried.

00:00:40.206 --> 00:00:42.375
I did what I did for Will's sake.

00:00:42.667 --> 00:00:43.918
West Philly Will is back, baby!

00:00:44.294 --> 00:00:46.087
But he's reverting back to his old ways.

00:00:46.087 --> 00:00:46.963
Let's go.

00:00:48.465 --> 00:00:49.674
There's this big time scout

00:00:49.674 --> 00:00:51.426
and he's helped a lot of dudes get to the pros.

00:00:51.801 --> 00:00:52.969
That fancy Bel-Air team

00:00:52.969 --> 00:00:54.679
got you and your game soft.

00:00:54.888 --> 00:00:56.806
If you come work with me, sky's the limit!

00:00:58.850 --> 00:00:59.851
We need to talk about our partnership.

00:00:59.851 --> 00:01:00.727
You're a boss,

00:01:00.727 --> 00:01:01.895
I'm just trying to bring it out.

00:01:01.895 --> 00:01:02.937
If you don't set the tone,

00:01:02.937 --> 00:01:04.773
she's gonna keep on walking all over you.

00:01:05.940 --> 00:01:08.068
I was trying to be someone different.

00:01:08.068 --> 00:01:09.861
The BSU, the protest,

00:01:09.861 --> 00:01:11.613
all people see are my mistakes.

00:01:11.905 --> 00:01:14.199
Never ever let anyone try to change you.

00:01:16.159 --> 00:01:17.994
Can't believe you're going back so soon.

00:01:19.079 --> 00:01:21.247
Well, Babe, you know 
I can't sit still for too long.

00:01:22.082 --> 00:01:24.209
When is it my time to feel valued?

00:01:26.336 --> 00:01:27.754
I wish to create a legacy

00:01:27.754 --> 00:01:29.130
where we are represented.

00:01:31.091 --> 00:01:32.967
I think it's time you take 
the gloves off, Baby.

00:01:32.967 --> 00:01:33.635
Right, Carlton?

00:01:34.719 --> 00:01:35.386
Carlton!

00:01:37.305 --> 00:01:38.431
You need to watch your mouth!

00:01:38.431 --> 00:01:39.808
Maybe I am on the wrong team.

00:01:40.517 --> 00:01:41.768
We can't be friends anymore.

00:01:42.977 --> 00:01:43.978
He can't do this to you!

00:01:43.978 --> 00:01:45.480
Fight for your principles!

00:01:45.897 --> 00:01:48.691
I have anxiety trying to fit into 
this goddamn Bel-Air bubble!

00:01:48.691 --> 00:01:49.818
We all need to step up!

00:01:50.735 --> 00:01:52.320
You got any Geoffrey wisdom?

00:01:53.029 --> 00:01:53.738
(chuckles)

00:01:54.739 --> 00:01:56.032
Nothing that you wanna hear.

